/xyz/urlScraper.js return codes interpretation:

100 failure:
  database insert error (url or odd)
21 failure:
  could not get sportName
20 failure:
  sport mapping does not exist
11 failure:
  redirected. This can happen if the match is in the past
10 failure:
  there is an element on the page indicating that the match is in the past, is live and/or doesn't exist
0 success:
  successfully retrieved all available markets. Note that  live odds are 
  not being scraped
-1 critical failure:
  some critical error thrown when scraping. Could also be a Timeout. No odds were scraped.
-10 critical failure:
  one of the required files could not be opened
-100 critical failure:
  database critical insert error (match or market)